{"id":"cabinet:gem+gemr","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The cut gems (bottom-left green oct5 and right-side sm4/sm5) narrow to 2-3px bottom rows so their left and right sides overhang in mid-air above the planks like floating beads, while the middle cyan cluster sits on a 10px flat grey slab that spans nearly the whole bay."}
{"id":"cabinet:bolt+boltg+boltr","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The single-fold items read as flat rounded pots or soap bars rather than fabric bolts, the 4px right-hand stacks have a 1px right-side notch that looks like a mug handle, and the middle-left blue/yellow stack reads like a burger."}
{"id":"cabinet:bottle+bottler+bottleb","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"Every upright bottle (wine5, wine6, jug4) places its 2px cork (.cC.) at x=1..2 over a 3px neck (olo.) at x=0..2, making all corks visibly off-center to the right like a crooked stair-step, and the bright shoulder highlight merges vertically into the white label below it."}
{"id":"cabinet:candle","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"Every pillar candle has a 2px-tall cold grey-blue rod (k) cutting vertically into its top rim (and floating between the flame and wax on the middle-left lit candle), while the 6px-wide yellow brass taper bases look like heavy anvils and overwrite the cabinet's right wooden post on the middle shelf."}
{"id":"cabinet:cheese","view34":"PASS","quality":"FAIL","reason":"The small wedges (wedge5s) slope up to the right with a vertical dark bar on the right so they read as jagged stair-steps or boots rather than cheese wedges, and the half-wheels (half6, half5) stack a flat horizontal rind stripe over a flat cream rectangle instead of showing a 3/4 cut wedge."}
